      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Dr. Patel, a primary collaborator at the Institute of Nano Science and Technology, works with Christiane Zarfl on developing nanomaterials for environmental remediation."</data>
      <data key="d5">"collaboration, research partnership"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0310</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;UNIVERSITY OF TÜBINGEN&quot;" target="&quot;INSTITUTE OF NANO SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"Both institutions are involved in cutting-edge research, with the University of Tübingen having a strong track record in environmental science and the Institute of Nano Science and Technology focusing on nanotechnology."</data>
      <data key="d5">"research collaboration, interdisciplinary approach"</data>
      <data key="d6">cb-0310</data>
    </edge>
